less"},"attributedDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Taken from Rick Astley’s sold-out Reflections Tour, this live performance of “Angels On My Side” was recorded at London’s O2 Arena in April 2026.\n\nOriginally featured on Rick’s chart-topping album 50, this live version of \"Angels On My Side\" is now included on the 10th Anniversary Deluxe Edition of 50, celebrating a decade since the album’s release.\n\n50 (10th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) is out now via BMG.\n\nBuy/Stream: https://rickastley.lnk.to/50Anniversary\n\nSubscribe to the official Rick Astley YouTube channel: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/YTSubID \n\nFollow Rick Astley:\nFacebook: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/FBFollowID  \nTwitter: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/TwitterID  \nInstagram: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/InstagramID \nWebsite: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/storeID \nTikTok: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/TikTokID\n\nListen to Rick Astley:\nSpotify: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/SpotifyID \nApple Music: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/AppleMusicID \nAmazon Music: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/AmazonMusicID \nDeezer: https://RickAstley.lnk.to/DeezerID \n\n#RickAstley","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":423,"length":39,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBUQ040EGAUiEwjys5vx9p6XAxW0UcMAHdSNFFdI39CHvNjnr7g9ygEEmDX49w==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUZZTVljRWNPS0tublVWWC0zQkFIYklPVmxiYXxBTl9pYzRlTTc0ZXdteFREQS1JTjN0enV0akJnRFd4ZlZMS1JyLTVWcU9jdVpMeGhCSFRPaVBaUDBndUtsYlI4VlRKcTl4QkxfWTF2Ymxta29qbEJHZXNPX1dpRHdDZkpmSUd3&q=https%3A%2F%2Frickastley.lnk.to%2F50Anniversary&v=PXC_PYeB6F8","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUZZTVljRWNPS0tublVWWC0zQkFIYklPVmxiYXxBTl9pYzRlTTc0ZXdteFREQS1JTjN0enV0akJnRFd4ZlZMS1JyLTVWcU9jdVpMeGhCSFRPaVBaUDBndUtsYlI4VlRKcTl4QkxfWTF2Ymxta29qbEJHZXNPX1dpRHdDZkpmSUd3&q=https%3A%2F%2Frickastley.lnk.to%2F50Anniv